  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> <strong>Dragon's Terror</strong> (Magic action): a creature you can see within 30 ft makes a WIS save (DC 8 + WIS modifier + Proficiency Bonus) or is Frightened until the end of your next turn (on a success, or when it ends, it's immune for 24 hours - the DM tracks this). <strong>Inspired by Fear</strong>: when you frighten a creature you can gain Heroic Inspiration if you lack it (once per Short or Long Rest; the module asks). You know Draconic.</p>",
